			"content:textarea:16:70": {
				"icon": "align-justify",
				"name": "Paragraph",
				"type": "textarea",
				"html": "<p>\n\tThe full-length basketball court and gymnasium lends space for a wide variety of physical activities. With a total of 6 drop-down basketball hoops, it is the perfect location for a pick-up or league basketball game. When the basketball hoops are raised, the gymnasium floor can be transformed for soccer, volleyball, relay races, dodgeball and many other activities.\n</p>",
				"description": "Mixed Plain and Rich Text",
				"draggable": true,
				"content": "The full-length basketball court and gymnasium lends space for a wide variety of physical activities. With a total of 6 drop-down basketball hoops, it is the perfect location for a pick-up or league basketball game. When the basketball hoops are raised, the gymnasium floor can be transformed for soccer, volleyball, relay races, dodgeball and many other activities.",
